  "interpretation": "Paired contrast MDE uses sigma of ORB minus controls; absolute gate needs sigma of ORB. Both are unknown and must be measured separately. At true absolute $20 a raw >=$15 gate has power Phi(5/SE); alternative lower CI >$15 has power Phi(5/SE-zcrit). Joint power for two gates is NOT product and cannot be computed without joint dev distributions. The 455 heldout n is an illustrative assumption, not an audited count.",
